#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/construct-circuits/extracted-outputs/3c0633db-929b-4428-a888-7a3d493bd6dd-0.svg)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/construct-circuits/extracted-outputs/3c0633db-929b-4428-a888-7a3d493bd6dd-0.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"measure-qubits\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"measure-qubits\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Measure qubits {#measure-qubits}"
msgstr "qubit 측정 {#measure-qubits}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Measurements are used to sample the states of individual qubits and transfer the results to a classical register. Note that if you are submitting circuits to a [Sampler](/guides/get-started-with-sampler) primitive, measurements are required. However, circuits submitted to an [Estimator](/guides/get-started-with-estimator) primitive must not contain measurements.\n"
msgstr "측정은 개별 Qubit의 상태를 샘플링하고 결과를 고전 레지스터로 전달하는 데 사용돼요. [Sampler](/guides/get-started-with-sampler) 프리미티브에 Circuit을 제출하는 경우 측정이 필요해요. 그러나 [Estimator](/guides/get-started-with-estimator) 프리미티브에 제출하는 Circuit에는 측정이 포함되어서는 안 돼요.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qubits can be measured using three methods: [`measure`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit.measure), [`measure_all`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#measure_all) and [`measure_active`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#measure_active). To learn how to visualize measured results, see the [Visualize results](/guides/visualize-results) page.\n"
msgstr "Qubit은 [`measure`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit.measure), [`measure_all`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#measure_all), [`measure_active`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#measure_active) 세 가지 메서드로 측정할 수 있어요. 측정 결과를 시각화하는 방법은 [결과 시각화](/guides/visualize-results) 페이지를 참고하세요.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`QuantumCircuit.measure` : measures each qubit in the first argument onto the classical bit given as the second argument. This method allows full control over where the measurement result is stored.\n"
msgstr "`QuantumCircuit.measure` : 첫 번째 인수의 각 Qubit을 두 번째 인수로 지정된 고전 비트에 측정해요. 이 메서드는 측정 결과가 저장되는 위치를 완전히 제어할 수 있어요.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`QuantumCircuit.measure_all` : takes no argument and can be used for quantum circuits without pre-defined classical bits. It creates classical wires and stores measurement results in order. For example, measurement of  qubit $q_i$ is stored in cbit $meas_i$). It also adds a barrier before the measurement.\n"
msgstr "`QuantumCircuit.measure_all` : 인수를 받지 않으며, 미리 정의된 고전 비트가 없는 양자 Circuit에 사용할 수 있어요. 고전 와이어를 생성하고 측정 결과를 순서대로 저장해요(예: Qubit $q_i$의 측정 결과는 cbit $meas_i$에 저장돼요). 측정 전에 배리어(barrier)도 추가돼요.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "`QuantumCircuit.measure_active` : similar to `measure_all`, but measures only qubits that have operations.\n"
msgstr "`QuantumCircuit.measure_active` : `measure_all`과 유사하지만, 연산이 있는 Qubit만 측정해요.\n"

